/P 143 0 R
/E (In this project, I developed a predictive maintenance model for industrial machinery using IBM watsonx.ai Studio and AutoAI. By working with real-time sensor data and applying the Snap Random Forest Classifier, I was able to accurately classify failure types such as tool wear, overheating, and power failure. The model showed strong predictive performance, making it suitable for proactive maintenance that can reduce downtime and operational costs.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
